<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>تم تأكيد طلبك {{ name }} ✅</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Readex+Pro:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  body { margin:0; padding:0; background:#F4F6F5; }
  a { color:#14532D; }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .ah-card { border-radius:0 !important; } .ah-pad { padding:24px 20px !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body dir="rtl" style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F4F6F5">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F4F6F5"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 8px">
<table role="presentation" class="ah-card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden">
  <tr><td style="background:#ffffff;padding:22px 28px;text-align:center">
    {% if shop.email_logo_url %}<img src="{{ shop.email_logo_url }}" alt="{{ shop.name }}" width="{{ shop.email_logo_width | default: 170 }}" style="max-width:210px;height:auto">{% else %}<span style="font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#14532D">{{ shop.name }}</span>{% endif %}
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="height:5px;line-height:5px;background:#14532D">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="height:3px;line-height:3px;background:#B6F23A">&nbsp;</td></tr>
  <tr><td class="ah-pad" style="padding:32px 36px;text-align:right;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;color:#0B0F0C">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;color:#14532D">الطلب {{ order_name | default: name }}</p><h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;color:#0B0F0C">شكراً لطلبك!</h1><p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#2B332E">مرحباً {{ customer.first_name }}، استلمنا طلبك ونقوم بتجهيزه الآن. سنبلغك فور خروجه للتوصيل.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #E6EAE7">
{% for line in subtotal_line_items %}
<tr>
  <td width="72" style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EAE7;vertical-align:top">{% if line.image %}<img src="{{ line.image | img_url: 'compact_cropped' }}" width="60" height="60" alt="" style="display:block;border-radius:10px;background:#F3F8EE;object-fit:contain">{% endif %}</td>
  <td style="padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EAE7;vertical-align:top;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;text-align:right">
    <strong style="font-weight:600">{{ line.title }}</strong>{% if line.variant.title != blank and line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %}<br><span style="color:#5B6660;font-size:13px">{{ line.variant.title }}</span>{% endif %}
    <br><span style="color:#5B6660;font-size:13px">الكمية: {{ line.quantity }}</span>
  </td>
  <td style="padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #E6EAE7;vertical-align:top;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#0B0F0C;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left"><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate;white-space:nowrap">{{ line.final_line_price | money }}</span></td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:12px"><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#5B6660;font-weight:400;text-align:right">المجموع الفرعي</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;font-weight:500;text-align:left"><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate;white-space:nowrap">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</span></td></tr>{% if total_discounts > 0 %}<tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#5B6660;font-weight:400;text-align:right">الخصم</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;font-weight:500;text-align:left"><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate;white-space:nowrap">−{{ total_discounts | money }}</span></td></tr>{% endif %}{% if shipping_price %}<tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#5B6660;font-weight:400;text-align:right">التوصيل</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;font-weight:500;text-align:left"><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate;white-space:nowrap">{{ shipping_price | money }}</span></td></tr>{% endif %}{% if tax_price > 0 %}<tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#5B6660;font-weight:400;text-align:right">ضريبة القيمة المضافة</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;font-weight:500;text-align:left"><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate;white-space:nowrap">{{ tax_price | money }}</span></td></tr>{% endif %}<tr><td colspan="2" style="border-top:1px solid #E6EAE7;height:8px;line-height:8px">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#0B0F0C;font-weight:700;text-align:right">الإجمالي</td><td style="padding:6px 0;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#0B0F0C;font-weight:700;text-align:left"><span dir="ltr" style="unicode-bidi:isolate;white-space:nowrap">{{ total_price | money }}</span></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:16px"><tr><td style="padding:14px 18px;border:1.5px solid #B6F23A;border-radius:12px;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;text-align:right">
<strong>💵 الدفع عند الاستلام</strong> — يرجى تجهيز المبلغ — تدفع عند وصول طلبك.</td></tr></table>{% if shipping_address %}<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:24px"><tr><td style="padding:16px 18px;background:#F3F8EE;border-radius:12px;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C;text-align:right">
<strong style="display:block;margin-bottom:6px">عنوان التوصيل</strong><div dir="auto">{{ shipping_address | format_address }}</div></td></tr></table>{% endif %}<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:24px 0 8px"><tr><td style="border-radius:999px;background:#14532D">
<a href="{{ order_status_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px">عرض طلبك</a></td></tr></table>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:22px 28px;background:#F3F8EE;text-align:center;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:14px;color:#0B0F0C">لديك سؤال؟ نرد بسرعة عبر واتساب.</p>
    <a href="https://wa.me/966541770519" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:999px;background:#1FA855;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">تواصل عبر واتساب</a>
  </td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:22px 28px 26px;text-align:center;font-family:'Readex Pro', Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0B0F0C">تابعنا</p>
    <a href="https://www.snapchat.com/@athletic_horse" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFC00;color:#111111;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">Snapchat</a><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@athletic_horse" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#111111;color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">TikTok</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/athletic_horseksa" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0B0F0C;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">Instagram</a><a href="https://wa.me/966541770519" style="display:inline-block;margin:0 4px 8px;padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;background:#FFFFFF;color:#0B0F0C;border:1px solid #E6EAE7;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">WhatsApp</a>
    <p style="margin:14px 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#5B6660">إرجاع سهل خلال 3 أيام من الاستلام.</p>
    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;color:#5B6660">شركة الحصان الرياضي · س.ت 7053046608 · الرقم الضريبي 314498395700003</p>
    <p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#5B6660">البغدادية الشرقية، جدة، المملكة العربية السعودية · <a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="color:#14532D">{{ shop.url | remove: 'https://' }}</a></p>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>